This license covers what was written for this repository: the working DTD and
SGML declaration in dtd/, the tools, the tests and the documentation.

It does not cover what is the United States Securities and Exchange
Commission's: the specification in sec/pds_dissemination_spec.pdf and what is
taken from it (sec/dtd-as-printed.txt, sec/tags.json), and the headers of
filings in tests/fixtures/, which are public records from SEC's EDGAR system.
